4040 0 obj
  << /ActualText (My partner and I train for several sports and physical abilities in any given week\056 Up until now\054 we kept our plans scattered across a spreadsheet\054 a notes app\054 a timer\054 our calendars and pen \053 paper\056 The whole process felt messy\054 dispersed\054 and unsustainable\056 \nWe created Ganbare \050\034go for it\035 in Japanese\051 to centralise all\240five with one weekly view we actually open and use every day\056\n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 4041 0 R
     /Pg 3146 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

