4044 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We had our own and joint reasons to build an app together\056 \n\nI wanted to\072 \nApply and put in practice what I learned in the UX design and product management courses I took to upskill my career into product\056\nIncrease my hireability in today\031s product job market\056\nLearn how to use product tools e\056g\056 Figma for design\054 Claude AI\054 and VS Code\n\nMy partner was all about what he was going to learn\054 as well as the bonus that he actually wanted to use the product\056 He wanted to learn how to vibe\055code\054 build a full app with htmx\053Golang\054 and how to use figma\056 \n\nJointly\054  we are both on this big health journey of getting back into shape\056 We needed a tool that could\072 \nHelp us to commit to our training goals with its design and features \nMake it as easy as possible to stick to new and healthy habits \nBring consistency within our training \nMaterialize abstract goals through quantifiable data \n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 4045 0 R
     /Pg 3146 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

4045 0 obj
  << /K [ 4044 0 R ]
     /P 4166 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 3146 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

