4048 0 obj
  << /ActualText (So here we are\056 Ganbare\056 Several needs\054 one deed\056 \n\nWe designed an app that supports our objectives of training and organising ourselves towards a healthier lifestyle\056 It brought structure and ease of organisation in our week\056 No more need to use several tools to track one thing\056 \n \nChecked off on our list\072 \nProvided a UX that is effective in its simplicity\056 No fuss\054 no unnecessary features\056 Only what we need to manage our training\056  \nNo more spreadsheet\054 timer\054 pen \046 paper\054 digital notes\054 calendar \055 just one app\056 \nBoth of us started to use Figma for our work\054 learning the basics\056 \nI started using Claude AI and VS code within product work and beyond\056 \nI put into practice what I learned in the courses into my own actual product\054 from ideation to launch\056 \n\nMy partner\031s testimony on Ganbare\072 \n\034One of the big values the product brings for me is that it\047s easier for me to stay consistent with my exercise if I have my planned sessions written down somewhere\054 and have a weekly goal I\047m trying to hit\035\056 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 19 ]
     /P 4049 0 R
     /Pg 3146 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

