4056 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Multiple sports\054 many environments\054 different muscle targets\054 busy schedules\054 no centralised view\056 We had reached for whatever tool fit each job \024 and lost the ability to see any of it together\056 It kept us afloat for a while\054 but we realised it was a temporary solution that couldn\047t support our long term goals\056\n\240\050We needed a tool to stay organised but more importantly\054 committed\056 We wanted to harness organisation to create discipline and yield commitment\056 A way to keep tabs on our progress and help us manage our week between training\054 recovery days and our favourite sport activities\056\240\050Once we committed to structured training across multiple sports\054 we needed to be able to plan sessions easily\054 create and log workouts\054 time intervals\054 record sets and reps\054 and see the week at a glance all in one place\056\240\050We combined our skills and knowledge to solve our problem and created\240Ganbare\072 the app to help us achieve our fitness goals\054 support our exercise habits and honour our long\055term commitments for a healthy life\056 )
     /K [ 23 ]
     /P 4057 0 R
     /Pg 3146 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

