4152 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We both use Ganbaru daily\056\050It\047s a small product\072 we designed it that way so that it answers our essential needs without unnecessary flourish or superficial features\056\240\050As our physical abilities change and our pull to certain sports fluctuates\054 so do our training goals\056 We know we will need the app to evolve with us\056\240\050We went about the process our own way\054 using industry standards across the UX\054 product and software fields\054 cutting out what we didn\047t need\056\240\050\050We started with a first version that supports a solid structure and has room for growth\056 When looking at the next version of Ganbaru and scoping out what it needs to become\054 we will be looking at adding\072\240\050\050\050\n)
     /K [ 71 ]
     /P 4153 0 R
     /Pg 3146 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

